<h1>Preferences - Display - Labels</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">The options in this group are related to <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Labeling</i></span> mode.</p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../images/preferences_labels.gif" width="593px" height="367px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head">Preview group</p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">Contains preview screen where all changes to the settings of the labels are updated.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Test name</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Example name of the label for preview only.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">&#160;</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Name only</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Check this option to display on the label only the name of the entity.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Vertical</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Check this option to display all XYZ co-ordinates and IJK axes vertically.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Decimal places</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Number of decimal digits for the numeric values. Default value is 4 digits.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Font</b></span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Press this button to call the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Font</b></span> dialog, from where the labels font name, font style, and font size can be changed.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle" id="p2">Opacity slider</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" id="p2"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Sets the transparency of the labels. Moving the slider to left makes the labels more transparent.</span></p>

